# Row I1.2: Add a candidate. Only the recruiter (and the admin) writes. A body of {} writes nothing: the recruiter is answered
# 400 (a sentence per bad field), never refused. Staff without ManageCandidates are refused with 403 before the input is read, and
# the tenant gate answers 403 to a person with no grant, no session and a candidate's guest cookie.
POST /api/interviews/candidates | hiringManager=403 interviewer=403 interviewer2=403 workOnly=403 anon=403 guest=403 | recruiter | {}
